      "text": "The Turkish occupation army and its mercenaries shelled the populated village of Sheshi in the western countryside of the occupied city of Girê Spi.\n\nAs a result, Kawthar Hajj Khalil, 45, was seriously injured, and Mizgin Hajj Khalil, 11, was seriously injured and subsequently transferred to the Kobani city hospital.\n\nA\n\nANHA\n\nOther news\n\nInternal Security Forces: Turkish occupation has been shelling border villages since this morning\n\nGire Spi Council with warning on resettlement of refugees in occupied territories\n\nPart of communications tower collapsed in Zarghan district as a result of Turkish bombing"
    }
